From 60fdb31c969e9693b70aaa1cb825a013c396f4cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:29:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Test an in-memory BIP340 CHECKSIG spend.

ConnectOrdinaryBlock accepts one ordinary spend whose witness is the
parent coin's CHECKSIG script and whose signature VerifyBip340Signature
already accepted. A mutated signature is rejected and the parent UTXO
root and monetary bytes are unchanged. This is an in-memory connect
test, not ConnectTip, and it does not claim that lotusd accepted a block.
---
